    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   <br>Psychedelia: The Psychonaut is a pixel art action-adventure where you blaze your way through a psychedelic rebellion. Your motorbike\u2019s been stolen. The world\u2019s been taken over by tyrants and a secret lizard government. Only one thing left to do: trip harder than reality can handle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996450/extras/2eed7a5dbc818fbca2bf852a2f281b36.avif?t=1747906899\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychedelia: The Psychonaut is a trippy action-adventure game about rebellion, consciousness, and getting your stolen motorbike back. Inspired by real psychedelic experiences and the bizarre beauty of small-town life, this game blends top-down Zelda-style exploration with mind-bending visuals and absurd stoner humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every drug you take transforms the visuals, the vibe, and sometimes even what you\u2019re fighting. Drop acid to expose the truth. Eat shrooms to face your demons. Smoke DMT to leave reality behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With every trip, the world distorts \u2014 pixel art warps, characters shift, and the line between real and unreal vanishes. Fight back with a lighter in one hand and a burning need for freedom in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Handcrafted pixel art that morphs when you\u2019re tripping </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique visual effects for LSD, shrooms, and DMT </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hilarious, weird characters based on real people and places </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Boss fights against tyrants, lizard people and your own subconscious </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A soundtrack that goes hard \u2014 then gets weird </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Stoner humor with a soul</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">   <br>Psychedelia: The Psychonaut is a pixel art action-adventure where you blaze your way through a psychedelic rebellion. Your motorbike\u2019s been stolen. The world\u2019s been taken over by tyrants and a secret lizard government. Only one thing left to do: trip harder than reality can handle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1996450/extras/2eed7a5dbc818fbca2bf852a2f281b36.avif?t=1747906899\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychedelia: The Psychonaut is a trippy action-adventure game about rebellion, consciousness, and getting your stolen motorbike back. Inspired by real psychedelic experiences and the bizarre beauty of small-town life, this game blends top-down Zelda-style exploration with mind-bending visuals and absurd stoner humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every drug you take transforms the visuals, the vibe, and sometimes even what you\u2019re fighting. Drop acid to expose the truth. Eat shrooms to face your demons. Smoke DMT to leave reality behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> With every trip, the world distorts \u2014 pixel art warps, characters shift, and the line between real and unreal vanishes. Fight back with a lighter in one hand and a burning need for freedom in the other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Handcrafted pixel art that morphs when you\u2019re tripping </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique visual effects for LSD, shrooms, and DMT </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Hilarious, weird characters based on real people and places </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Boss fights against tyrants, lizard people and your own subconscious </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 A soundtrack that goes hard \u2014 then gets weird </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Stoner humor with a soul</p>",
